{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_claims_count", "text": "According to the paper, the FEVER dataset contains around 185k claims.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_corpus_size", "text": "The claims are drawn from a corpus of 5.4M Wikipedia articles.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_claims", "text": "根据 Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking 一文，FEVER 数据集包含大约 185k（18.5 万）条声明（claims）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_corpus", "text": "这些声明来自一个包含 5.4M（540 万）篇维基百科文章的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_label_size", "text": "论文称 FEVER 是最大的数据集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_claims_count", "text": "论文指出 FEVER 是最大的数据集，约含 185k 条 claims。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_corpus_size", "text": "论文指出这些 claims 来自规模为 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_label_set", "text": "论文说明 FEVER 中的 claims 依据证据集被标注为 “SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES” 或 “NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "method_uses_wikipedia_pages", "text": "论文称其模型以无监督方式从所提供的 Wikipedia 页面中学习语言模型与语言学特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_transformed_cloze", "text": "论文提出通过遮蔽 claims 中的命名实体，将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze 任务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "questions_per_claim", "text": "论文报告平均每条 claim 生成 3 个问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
